{%- comment -%}
  Buybox Shipping Text

  Two independent lines — both can show at the same time:
  - "This item ships FREE!" (truck icon) when the variant costs more than $299
    and weighs under 120 (weight_in_unit). Rendered first / on top.
  - "Usually ships in X-X business days." — always rendered, on its own line
    underneath.

  The free-shipping line is always in the DOM so the JS variant-switcher
  (updateShipping) can toggle it; only the state matching the initial variant is
  visible, which also keeps it correct with JS disabled.

  @param current_variant  - the currently selected variant
  @param shipping_window  - e.g. "3-5"; resolved by the section (product
                            metafield → vendor metaobject → theme default)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign current_variant = current_variant | default: product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
{%- assign shipping_window = shipping_window | default: '3-5' -%}
{%- assign ships_free = false -%}
{%- if current_variant.price > 29900 and current_variant.weight_in_unit < 120 -%}
  {%- assign ships_free = true -%}
{%- endif -%}

<span class="buybox-shipping-free shipping-option"{% unless ships_free %} style="display: none;"{% endunless %}>
  {%- render 'icon-truck' -%}
  <span>This item ships FREE!</span>
</span>
<span class="buybox-shipping-standard">
  Usually ships in {{ shipping_window }} business days.
</span>
